{"2540820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starfend", "steam_appid": 2540820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tower Defense That Becomes a Roguelite</h2><br>Prepare your fleet, equip your stones, and level your skills. Then hold the line: place defensive drones and pilot your own combat drone against relentless waves of meteors. Clear the waves and Survival Mode begins, where you push as deep as you dare for rare loot. The deeper you go, the more it becomes a roguelite of builds, synergies, and risk.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/9869bc03f9e3d7931945ddd1ea9aa2b5.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/9869bc03f9e3d7931945ddd1ea9aa2b5.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/9869bc03f9e3d7931945ddd1ea9aa2b5.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW: Online Co-op (Open Beta)</h2><br>Team up with up to 3 friends and defend one Earth together over Steam. Share a single run, hold the line side by side, and revive each other when a wave breaks through.<br><br>Co-op is a toolbox, not one fixed mode. Flip rules in the lobby, friendly fire, separate gold, per-player synergy, mirrored lanes, sudden death, and new modes appear on their own, from kill races to full PvP. Start from a preset, or share your ruleset with a code.<br><br>Online co-op is a free open beta in active development, and it is playable in the free demo, so you can try it before you buy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/5e80968bb389f40f2397a969562aa992.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/5e80968bb389f40f2397a969562aa992.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/5e80968bb389f40f2397a969562aa992.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Different Run Every Time</h2><br>In the Prepare Phase you build your drone from the ground up: pick a body, attach arms, and equip guns by color. Your colors decide your synergies, your firepower, and the upgrades open to you. There is no default loadout, every run starts with a decision.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/dda13190b6bfa48854fb577f3197fb3e.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/dda13190b6bfa48854fb577f3197fb3e.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/dda13190b6bfa48854fb577f3197fb3e.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pilot It Actively</h2><br>Your main drone is not a static turret. Fly it across the battlefield and keep it alive with three active abilities: Teleport out of incoming fire, raise a Shield when you need a hard stop, and spend gold to Repair on the fly. Meteors actively hunt you between waves, so stay mobile or lose it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wave Buff Cards</h2><br>After each wave, choose 2 upgrade cards from 5 random options, split between cannon upgrades (crit, attack speed, power, range) and utility upgrades (drone speed, pickup range, cooldowns, instant repairs). With 48 cards and no fixed order, no two runs build the same.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/532e3d1e3852ae4465debc714ec2cdba.avif?t=1785239710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras_big/532e3d1e3852ae4465debc714ec2cdba.avif?t=1785239710 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Devastating Color Synergies</h2><br>Combine drones of matching colors, Grey, Red, Green, Blue and 6 hybrids, to unlock global damage multipliers that amplify your entire fleet. Stack multiple synergies and the effect compounds. The deeper your color investment, the harder everything hits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/72edb6e60cc0744e9ed95bc7ef9830c1.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/72edb6e60cc0744e9ed95bc7ef9830c1.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/72edb6e60cc0744e9ed95bc7ef9830c1.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt Giant Meteors</h2><br>Giant Meteors appear throughout each run carrying powerful rewards. Destroy them before they escape to unlock active abilities and rare stones that can change the course of a run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/b794a2631b1c0ae9201dc4d7dea1146c.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/b794a2631b1c0ae9201dc4d7dea1146c.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/b794a2631b1c0ae9201dc4d7dea1146c.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger Every Run</h2><br>Between runs, invest in a persistent Skill Tree and a stone loadout system. Unlock new drone types, gun colors, hybrid combinations, and fleet upgrades. Every session builds your roster, even when you fall short.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/237906acc14a6303341a5ff3d6a90684.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/237906acc14a6303341a5ff3d6a90684.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/237906acc14a6303341a5ff3d6a90684.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>NEW: Online co-op for 2-4 players (open beta)<br></li><li>Roguelite tower defense in 3D space<br></li><li>Build and pilot your own combat drone<br></li><li>Place and customize a fleet of autonomous defensive drones<br></li><li>Color-based synergies and deep build combinations<br></li><li>Wave Buff cards, 48 in the pool, for run-defining choices<br></li><li>Active abilities and rare stones earned from Giant Meteors<br></li><li>Endless Survival Mode and Steam leaderboards<br></li><li>Permanent progression and unlockables</li></ul><br>If you enjoy the build depth of Brotato, the strategic layering of Dungeon Warfare 2, or the &quot;one more run&quot; pull of 20 Minutes Till Dawn, Starfend brings that same obsessive loop to 3D space tower defense.<br><br><strong>Build your fleet. Hold the line. Then survive.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/06c8456c41f585b08ada4dd8b442e3aa.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/06c8456c41f585b08ada4dd8b442e3aa.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/06c8456c41f585b08ada4dd8b442e3aa.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tower Defense That Becomes a Roguelite</h2><br>Prepare your fleet, equip your stones, and level your skills. Then hold the line: place defensive drones and pilot your own combat drone against relentless waves of meteors. Clear the waves and Survival Mode begins, where you push as deep as you dare for rare loot. The deeper you go, the more it becomes a roguelite of builds, synergies, and risk.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/9869bc03f9e3d7931945ddd1ea9aa2b5.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/9869bc03f9e3d7931945ddd1ea9aa2b5.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/9869bc03f9e3d7931945ddd1ea9aa2b5.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW: Online Co-op (Open Beta)</h2><br>Team up with up to 3 friends and defend one Earth together over Steam. Share a single run, hold the line side by side, and revive each other when a wave breaks through.<br><br>Co-op is a toolbox, not one fixed mode. Flip rules in the lobby, friendly fire, separate gold, per-player synergy, mirrored lanes, sudden death, and new modes appear on their own, from kill races to full PvP. Start from a preset, or share your ruleset with a code.<br><br>Online co-op is a free open beta in active development, and it is playable in the free demo, so you can try it before you buy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/5e80968bb389f40f2397a969562aa992.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/5e80968bb389f40f2397a969562aa992.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/5e80968bb389f40f2397a969562aa992.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Different Run Every Time</h2><br>In the Prepare Phase you build your drone from the ground up: pick a body, attach arms, and equip guns by color. Your colors decide your synergies, your firepower, and the upgrades open to you. There is no default loadout, every run starts with a decision.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/dda13190b6bfa48854fb577f3197fb3e.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/dda13190b6bfa48854fb577f3197fb3e.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/dda13190b6bfa48854fb577f3197fb3e.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pilot It Actively</h2><br>Your main drone is not a static turret. Fly it across the battlefield and keep it alive with three active abilities: Teleport out of incoming fire, raise a Shield when you need a hard stop, and spend gold to Repair on the fly. Meteors actively hunt you between waves, so stay mobile or lose it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wave Buff Cards</h2><br>After each wave, choose 2 upgrade cards from 5 random options, split between cannon upgrades (crit, attack speed, power, range) and utility upgrades (drone speed, pickup range, cooldowns, instant repairs). With 48 cards and no fixed order, no two runs build the same.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/532e3d1e3852ae4465debc714ec2cdba.avif?t=1785239710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras_big/532e3d1e3852ae4465debc714ec2cdba.avif?t=1785239710 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Devastating Color Synergies</h2><br>Combine drones of matching colors, Grey, Red, Green, Blue and 6 hybrids, to unlock global damage multipliers that amplify your entire fleet. Stack multiple synergies and the effect compounds. The deeper your color investment, the harder everything hits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/72edb6e60cc0744e9ed95bc7ef9830c1.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/72edb6e60cc0744e9ed95bc7ef9830c1.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/72edb6e60cc0744e9ed95bc7ef9830c1.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt Giant Meteors</h2><br>Giant Meteors appear throughout each run carrying powerful rewards. Destroy them before they escape to unlock active abilities and rare stones that can change the course of a run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/b794a2631b1c0ae9201dc4d7dea1146c.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/b794a2631b1c0ae9201dc4d7dea1146c.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/b794a2631b1c0ae9201dc4d7dea1146c.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger Every Run</h2><br>Between runs, invest in a persistent Skill Tree and a stone loadout system. Unlock new drone types, gun colors, hybrid combinations, and fleet upgrades. Every session builds your roster, even when you fall short.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/237906acc14a6303341a5ff3d6a90684.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/237906acc14a6303341a5ff3d6a90684.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/237906acc14a6303341a5ff3d6a90684.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>NEW: Online co-op for 2-4 players (open beta)<br></li><li>Roguelite tower defense in 3D space<br></li><li>Build and pilot your own combat drone<br></li><li>Place and customize a fleet of autonomous defensive drones<br></li><li>Color-based synergies and deep build combinations<br></li><li>Wave Buff cards, 48 in the pool, for run-defining choices<br></li><li>Active abilities and rare stones earned from Giant Meteors<br></li><li>Endless Survival Mode and Steam leaderboards<br></li><li>Permanent progression and unlockables</li></ul><br>If you enjoy the build depth of Brotato, the strategic layering of Dungeon Warfare 2, or the &quot;one more run&quot; pull of 20 Minutes Till Dawn, Starfend brings that same obsessive loop to 3D space tower defense.<br><br><strong>Build your fleet. Hold the line. Then survive.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/06c8456c41f585b08ada4dd8b442e3aa.poster.avif?t=1785239710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/06c8456c41f585b08ada4dd8b442e3aa.webm?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/extras/06c8456c41f585b08ada4dd8b442e3aa.mp4?t=1785239710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "short_description": "A roguelite tower defense in space. Build your fleet, place your drones, and hold the line against waves of meteors. Then enter Survival Mode to push deeper for rare loot. Hunt Giant Meteors to unlock and combine powerful skills, and chain color synergies for devastating damage.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“This indie gem delivers addictive tower-defense action with satisfying drone customization and color-synergy mechanics that reward strategy.”<br>TheBigBoisNews<br><br>“Tower defense in 3D space with interesting ideas and mechanics. An unusual gameplay that will interest fans of the genre with its novelty. Procedural level generation increases replayability.”<br>Gold Bear Games<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/d7c56b81919c789f334e4ebb023744ef6b4a5807/header.jpg?t=1785239710", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/7f28ab9491f24988d22abdc873adc4981cc996bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785239710", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540820/7f28ab9491f24988d22abdc873adc4981cc996bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785239710", "website": "https://starfend.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD RX 480 (DirectX 11 support required)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0 Big Sur (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (6th gen) or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-capable GPU (all Macs from 2012 o